 VR experience. Somewhere between Twin Peaks and The X-\u00adFiles, Dark Days is a new fantastic virtual reality adventure. You will have to discover what\u2019s going on with an eerie desert motel and its surroundings by solving a number of puzzles. Immerse yourself in the rich environments you will come across, but be careful and smart! Something is roaming around you... \n\n\u274f A supernatural adventure full of revelations \n\u274f Accessible gameplay and random puzzles \n\u274f Be prepared for jump scares! \n\nTechnical contact : contact@parallel-studio.com", "short_description": "\"Dark Days is probably the most visually complete game on the Gear VR\" -MobileVRDaily Somewhere between Twin Peaks and The X-\u00adFiles, Dark Days is a new fantastic virtual reality adventure. You will have to discover what\u2019s going on with an eerie desert motel and its surroundings by solving a number of puzzles. Immerse yourself in the rich environments you will come across, but be careful and smart! Something is roaming around you..."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.parallel-studio.com/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.parallel-studio.com/", "publisher_name": "Oculus Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.parallel-studio.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["ADVENTURE", "EXPLORATION", "HORROR", "NARRATIVE", "PUZZLE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "fr", "zh_CN", "ko", "de", "es_MX"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD", "GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "4789571044489703"}, "review